export anchor ZenInkStyle:
    number: 32
    screen: SignIn
    name: Zen ink
    idea: Japanese ink-brush calm, one sumi stroke and one red sun above a narrow column of hairline fields, with the brand written vertically down the edge and space doing most of the work.
    base: light
    palette:
        ricePaper: #fbfaf6, the page
        sumi: #1c1b19, text, the brush stroke, field lines and the primary button
        wash: #5e5b55, labels, small text and the or divider
        mist: #d9d6ce, resting hairlines between rows
        pale: #efede6, the half height wash behind a focused field
        sun: #c0392b, the single red dot, used nowhere else
    type:
        A Mincho serif for almost everything, Hiragino Mincho ProN, Yu
        Mincho, Noto Serif CJK JP, Songti SC, Georgia, Times New Roman,
        serif, and a Gothic sans for tiny labels, Hiragino Sans, Yu Gothic
        UI, Segoe UI, system-ui, sans-serif. The vertical brand is 26px with
        0.5em tracking, the heading 24px light with 0.08em tracking, field
        text 17px, body 15px weight 300 on a 1.9 line, labels 12px sans
        with 0.3em tracking, and the button 15px with 0.5em tracking.
    layout:
        A wide sheet of rice paper. One rough sumi brush stroke sweeps
        across the top left, and a red dot 44px wide sits alone near the
        top right. The brand runs vertically down the right edge with a
        small for small teams line beside it. The form is a narrow 340px
        column left of centre that starts about 220px down, under a short
        ink dash below the heading. Sign-in choices are hairline rows with
        ringed initials and an arrow. Privacy and Terms sit far below in
        tiny tracked sans. At 375px the stroke runs off the left edge, the
        vertical brand stays in a narrow strip on the right and the column
        fills the rest.
    spacing: An 8px unit used in large steps. 32px between fields, 48px between groups, 96px above the screen and about 220px of empty paper above the heading.
    density: Very sparse. A 340px column on a 1200px page.
    corners: Square buttons and fields. Only the sun, the round checkbox and the ringed initials are round.
    borders: 1px hairlines under fields and rows only. A dashed underline marks the field in error.
    shadows: None. Depth comes from the brush stroke alone.
    icons:
        Almost none. A hand drawn SVG brush stroke roughened with a
        turbulence filter, ringed letters G and M, a thin arrow on
        sign-in rows, a cross before the error, a filled dot in the
        round checkbox and a tick for done.
    focus: A 1px sumi outline offset 6px. A focused field gets a 3px sumi underline and a pale wash over its lower half.
    tone: Very few words, calm and unhurried. Labels whisper in widely tracked small type.
